      "content": "While sleep and stress are certainly related to anxiety, you should not treat potential heart symptoms with supplements alone. Melatonin and magnesium might help with sleep, but they will not rule out a cardiac event. For the sake of your health, if the pressure or numbness persists, you must get checked by a doctor immediately. A quick checkup is much better than ignoring potential danger.",
      "source": "target",
