      "content": "i hear you but i just can't justify the bill right now... it's probably just gas or tension. my friend had something similar and they said once they just relaxed and took some herbal tea and some ashwagandha it went away completely. if i just stay home, keep my breathing steady, and take a heavy dose of ashwagandha to calm my nerves, do u think i can just ride this out until the weekend?",
